<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 9/10.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 9/10.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, June 10 on Monday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   10.06.97	  09.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5268	    6.5224</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3216	    2.3095</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5238	    4.5038</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5587	    3.4560</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5142	    0.5146</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7722	    0.7691</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2902	    0.2887</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0132	    6.9692</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6937	    0.6938	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2395	    1.2374</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
